\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb125\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -409\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Dominikaner{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 brevier}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Dominikanisches Kalendarium; (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Komputistische Tafeln \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) leer; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Aderlasstafel, (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) leer; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Psalterium und Litanei; \endash  62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) De tempore; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 407\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) De sanctis; (407\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 408\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Benediktionen; (408\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 409\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Kleines Kreuzoffizium ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 AH 30, Nr. 13}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) und ko