\pard\fi0\li0\tx914\tx1828\tx2742\tx3669\tx4583\tx5497\tx6411\tx7325\tx8239\tx9166\tx10080\tx10994\tx11908\tx12822\tx13736\tx14650\ql\ri0\sb125\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Inhalt: 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Stundenbuch}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  in niederdeutscher Sprache. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Kalendar (K\u246 \'f6ln); (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Kreuzesoffizium, \u220 \'dcbersetzung von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Geert Groote}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Io 1,1\endash 14 niederdeutsch \endash  29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Kleines Marienoffizium, \u220 \'dcbersetzung von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Geert Groote}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Gebete zu Jesus Christus \endash  81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Mariengebete; (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Passionsgebete; (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Mariengebete; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Suffragien an die Heiligen Michael, Johannes Ev., Gertrud von Nivelles, Matth\u228 \'e4us, Christophorus \endash  155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Kommuniongebete; (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Gebete zur Dreifaltigkeit \endash  179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer; (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Totenoffizium; (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Marienrosenkranz \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer.}

