\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Anonymus : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in Job}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Z.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Zu Job 38,31-40,13: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nunquid coniungere poteris micantes stellas Pliades. Pliades ab oriente ...-... que autem virtus putatur difficilius, unde \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lamine f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <errae> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 comparantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; z.T. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius I papa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Job}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  lib.29,31-32,2\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. CC 143B S. 1481 Z. 1- S. 1663 Z. 48.; (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 19-41)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Samuel. Melior est obedientia quam victime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1 Rg 15,22)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia per victimas aliena caro ...-... Paulus ad adversa etiam ex suo voto ducitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 //; z.T. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius I papa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Job}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  lib.35,14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. CC 143B S. 1792 Z. 139 - S. 1795 Z. 240. Vgl. die Fragmente bei\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  9 Nr. 2635,2}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  6 Nr. 9813}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17.18 Zitat\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorius. Hoc mihi opere precium credo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...-... incunctanter aperio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

