\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber Psalmorum David., cum glosa interliniali. Ex bibliotheca Combergica. Non putemus in uerbis Scripturarum esse Euangelium, sed in sensu: Non in superfici\u230 \'e6, sed in medulla, non in sermonum folijs sed in radice rationis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Zitat \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hieronymus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Commentarius in epistolam Pauli Apostoli ad Galatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I,11-12, s. CC 78A S. 25)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  C Marchion 191\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber Psalmorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 , cum glossa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri Jhesu Christi, incipit prologus super psalterium // {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicendum est in primis, cur Psalterium ab omnibus primitus discatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Psalterium est clavis coeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 et ad medullam intimi intellectus, per Dei gratium perveneris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . AMEN.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit brevissimare collectio expositoria super psalterium. Prologus primus. // {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut olim manna habuit delectamentum est omnem Saporem suavitatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : sic carmen huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 et animam suam in coelo mundificabit in serulo serulorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundus prologus in librum psalmorum // {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gratia igitur assequendi et consequendi; melius paedictos salutares effertus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ista briuissima subsequens recollectio ex positoria super psalterium est ex glossa ordinaria et postillis bruiter excerpta, obmissis tamen expositione titulorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 totam materiam psalmi continentem. // EXPLICIT PROLOGVS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber psalmorum // Assint nobis ubique et semper cum beatis omnibus, Deus pater Deus filius, dominus noster Jhesus Christus, et et Deus Spiritus Sanctus. AMEN\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps 1 \endash  (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps 106. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  9 Nr. 5430,1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stuttgart, WLB, HB VII 46}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Basel, UB, cod. A III 28}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; zum Umfeld der \u220 \'dcberlieferung \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J. Black\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Psalm Uses in Carolingian Prayerbooks: Alcuin and the Preface to \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De psalmorum usu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: Mediaeval Studies 64 (2002) S. 1-60 (ohne diese Hs.).
